## ✅ Acceptance Criteria (Definition of 'Done')

This task will be considered complete and ready for review only if all the following criteria are met:

- [ ] The code implements the functionality described in the objective.
- [ ] The code passes all unit/integration tests.
- [ ] The code is internally documented with clear comments (e.g., how the main function works).
- [ ] Specific Task Criterion (e.g., Eye calibration maintains a deviation error below 50 pixels).

